      "observed": "REG3.1 is on +3.3V, while the separate +3V3 net does not connect to either MCU's VDD pins. The netlist explicitly lists every FCC and NAVC VDD pin as unconnected.",
      "expected": "The specification says the 3.3 V LDO supplies the MCUs and sensors. The MCU VDD pins should be connected to the regulated 3.3 V rail.",
